{"page":278,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:94","surah":16,"ayah":94,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَتَّخِذُوٓا۟ أَيْمَـٰنَكُمْ دَخَلًۢا بَيْنَكُمْ فَتَزِلَّ قَدَمٌۢ بَعْدَ ثُبُوتِهَا وَتَذُوقُوا۟ ٱلسُّوٓءَ بِمَا صَدَدتُّمْ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۖ وَلَكُمْ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not use your oaths to deceive each other lest any foot should slip after being firmly placed and lest you should taste the penalty for having hindered others from the path of God, and suffer terrible torment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَتَّخِذُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"take","transliteration":"tattakhidhū","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your oaths","transliteration":"aymānakum","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":4,"ar":"دَخَلًۢا","en_gloss":"(as) a deception","transliteration":"dakhalan","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيْنَكُمْ","en_gloss":"between you","transliteration":"baynakum","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَتَزِلَّ","en_gloss":"lest, should slip","transliteration":"fatazilla","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَدَمٌۢ","en_gloss":"a foot","transliteration":"qadamun","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ثُبُوتِهَا","en_gloss":"it is firmly planted","transliteration":"thubūtihā","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَتَذُوقُوا۟","en_gloss":"and you would taste","transliteration":"watadhūqū","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلسُّوٓءَ","en_gloss":"the evil","transliteration":"l-sūa","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":13,"ar":"صَدَدتُّمْ","en_gloss":"you hindered","transliteration":"ṣadadttum","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"16:94"},{"pos":15,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"16:9